{{also|Machen}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|-}}, from {{inh|de|goh|mahhōn}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*makōn}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*mag-|t=to knead, mix, make}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈmaxən/|[ˈmaχ(ə)n]|[ˈmäxən̩]|[ˈmäxɛn]|[ˈmɑχən]}}
* {{a|Germany}} {{audio|de|De-machen.ogg}}
* {{a|Austria|Southern Germany}} {{audio|de|De-at-machen.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|de|aχn}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|macht|machte|gemacht}}

# {{lb|de|transitive}} to [[make]], [[produce]], [[create]] (an object, arrangement, situation, etc.)
